option.cloudsCumulusWindAngle=풍향
option.cloudsCumulusWindAngle.comment=Direction the cumulus clouds drift in, in degrees. 0 degrees blows towards +Z, 90 degrees towards +X.
suffix.cloudsCumulusWindAngle=°
option.cloudShadowsIntensity=구름 그림자 강도
option.cloudShadowsIntensity.comment=How dark the shadows that clouds cast on the ground are. Higher values give deeper, better defined shadows under the clouds.
