option.boxMode=모드
option.boxMode.comment=선택 상자 모드
value.boxMode.boxModeNone=기본
value.boxMode.boxModeColor=사용자 지정 색상
value.boxMode.boxModeRainbow=무지개
option.boxLineWidth=선 굵기
option.boxLineWidth.comment=Thickness in pixels of the selection box outline. Higher values draw a thicker box.
option.boxColorR=빨강
option.boxColorR.comment=Red component of the selection box outline colour.
option.boxColorG=초록
option.boxColorG.comment=Green component of the selection box outline colour.
option.boxColorB=파랑
option.boxColorB.comment=Blue component of the selection box outline colour.
option.boxEmission=발광
option.boxEmission.comment=색상을 1 이상으로 스케일합니다. 블룸이 필요합니다.
screen.distanceView=거리 뷰
option.distanceView=활성화
option.distanceView.comment=Renders the scene from a far distance so you can spot landmarks that are too far away to reach. It is meant for scouting, not for playing.
option.distanceViewMethod=방식
option.distanceViewMethod.comment=Selects what the distance view uses to place the far away scene. Distance places it by its real distance, Depth uses the depth buffer instead.
value.distanceViewMethod.distanceViewDistance=거리
value.distanceViewMethod.distanceViewDepth=깊이
option.distanceViewMaxDistance=최대 거리
option.distanceViewMaxDistance.comment=Furthest distance the distance view shows. Objects beyond it are not drawn at all.
suffix.distanceViewMaxDistance=m
screen.tonemapComparison=톤매핑 비교
option.tonemapComparison=톤매핑 비교
option.tonemapComparison.comment=화면의 왼쪽과 오른쪽 절반에 두 가지 톤매핑 함수를 비교 표시합니다
option.tonemapLeft=왼쪽 톤매핑
option.tonemapLeft.comment=Tonemapping operator used for the left half of the screen while the tonemap comparison is enabled.
value.tonemapLeft.tonemapAcesFit=ACES Fit
value.tonemapLeft.tonemapAcesFull=ACES Full
value.tonemapLeft.tonemapLottes=Lottes
value.tonemapLeft.tonemapHejl2015=Hejl 2015
value.tonemapLeft.tonemapHejlBurgess=Hejl-Burgess
value.tonemapLeft.tonemapUncharted2=Uncharted 2
